  "description": "PART SINGLE STORY PART 2 STORY REAR EXTENSION, SIDE\r\nEXTENSION AT 1ST FLOOR LEVEL PLUS A FULL WIDTH MANSARD STYLE LOFT CONVERSION\r\nWITH ROOFLIGHTS ON THE FRONT SLOPE WITH RIDGE HEIGHT RAISED",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed extensions poorly designed and excessive in scale such that they would project excessively out from the rear of the building and, as such would reduce outlook and light&amp;nbsp; to the neighbouring first floor rear windows, adversely affect neighbour amenity.&amp;nbsp; Therefore, the proposal would fail to comply with Merton Local Plan 2014 policy D12.3.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The cumulatively the proposed extensions are excessive in scale and as such would fail to be subordinate to the host building. Therefore, the proposal would fail to comply with Merton Local Plan policies D12.1, D12.3 and D12.4.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
